codec.affinity.msg.no_preview = A hu na mbonalo ya phanḓa yo dzheniswaho ine ya nga shumiswa. Fomathi ya dziḽeyara ya Affinity ndi ya vhuṋe; Schist i dzhenisa mbonalo yo ṱanganyiswaho i re kha faela. Faela iyi a i nayo — i vhulungeni hafhu kha Affinity, kana ni i rumele sa PSD u itela u dzhenisa dziḽeyara dzoṱhe.
codec.heif.msg.no_library = libheif a i wanali ({details}). U vula HEIC zwi ṱoḓa ḽaiburari ya libheif (Linux: dzhenisani libheif1; macOS: brew install libheif).
